der.only cfg-order top> >top top c, , compile xliteral literal 2literal /string parse parse-name cskip cscan ?stack source-tib source throw catch handler .ready .ok .input .error ?crlf bs accept refill-tib refill .k .s ud.r ud. u. d. d.r . sign #> #s # <# hold hld allot align vp vp.max vp0 init.dp.flash >ram >flash dp dp.flash dp0.flash dp.ram dp0.ram here pad binary hex decimal ( [ spaces space bl cr first-run cell false true -1 4 2 1 0 bounds pause emit? serial-emit-pause emit key? serial-key-pause key state base dabs cfg-recognizer forth-recognizer split rectype-split rec-split rec-num rectype-dnum rectype-num rectype-xt rec-find rectype-null recognize interpret quit first-boot.done ?first-boot first-boot.marker first-boot.start warm std.erase std.unlock ~pvflash.erase ~flash.erase ~!i ~(,) ~(c,) ~(dallot) EOW flush flash.erase !i (c,) (,) (dallot) flash.max flash.low flash.start flash.erased flash.cell flash.page ms 1s 1ms naligned (dodoes) does> move 2rot cell- ashift nr> n>r compare (DOXLITERAL) (DOLITERAL) (DOCONDBRANCH) (DOBRANCH) up! up@ (DOUSER) pfa.odd odd (DODEFER) (DOVALUE) (DODATA) (DOVARIABLE) aligned (aligned) j i unloop (DOPLUSLOOP) (DOLOOP) (DODO) execute cold #tib tib chars cells cell+ 2/ 2* 2- 2+ 1- 1+ */mod */ um/mod sm/rem m/mod /mod u/mod mod / m* d0= d0< ud/mod s>d d2/ d2* 2r> 2>r 2r@ 2over 2nip 2swap umax umin max min = <> u> u< u<= u>= > < <= >= 0< 0<> 0= h! h@ c! c@ +! fill lshift rshift not or and rdrop rdepth depth abs ! @ sp0 sp sp! sp@ rp rp! rp@ r'@ r@ r> >r pick -rot tuck ?dup nip dup (exiti) exit (exit) * d- d+ dnegate - negate invert rot 2dup 2drop + um* xor swap over drop nop 
